[statement]
As `a-condition-s-negated-entry-keeps-its-name-out-of-the-package-s-dependencies`,
one package further down: `e` needs `z`, `z` needs `docs`, and `e`'s
condition forbids `docs`. No candidate is left for `docs` below `e`, and
apk refuses the request.

